WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Start with access and usage
Read the current version, period and usage. A billing restriction stops
new sales while authorized work on existing purchases remains available.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Review before confirming
The server fixes the amount, currency, effective period and 15-minute
expiry. A reviewed change is confirmed with a stable request key; a
redirect does not activate paid service.

3
